// Head Bezel Geometry Validity And Update — Hồi quy, liên kết, nghiệm thu E11
// ROLE: REGRESSION_STRESS - long-run / adversarial behaviour of an existing capability.
//
// Purpose: Head/Bezel validity & update: hồi quy, liên kết, nghiệm thu e11. gem resize → rebuild; invalid params → original doc intact; save/open/Undo/Redo diff
// Algorithm under stress: IsValid, closedness theo loại, stable IDs, rebuild deterministic, no phantom references. finite coordinates, legal units and tolerance inherited from signed G00 fixture, not invented here. OCCT Check/IsValid on every BRep result; expected intentionally-open result must be explicitly typed. No silent detach of gem/setting feature, stable IDs across recompute and persistence. None. Quy tắc M06/E11 + phần manual về Head/Bezel; không có heading riêng. Nếu L3 chỉ có parent_l2_range: đây là chỉ mục tra cứu bổ sung, không khẳng định manual có heading độc lập.
//
// Loop skeleton (choose the parameters from the fixture, then record them):
//   for round in 0..N {
//       apply the same operation to an increasingly large/pathological input
//       measure: wall time, allocation, handle/leak count, geometry drift vs tolerance
//       stop criterion: <max rounds> or <drift > tolerance> or <first failure>
//   }
//
// Assertions:
//   - results stay within the declared tolerance for every round
//   - no leaked OCCT/GPU resource: create/destroy counts balance
//   - the first failing round is reported with its input, not summarised away
// Positive oracle: E2E VALID: gem resize → rebuild; invalid params → original doc intact; save/open/Undo/Redo diff
// Negative oracle: OCCT failure; stale feature links; repeated rebuild; circular history graph
